%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'primaryColor':'#E3F3EC','primaryBorderColor':'#0F8B6D','lineColor':'#5C6963','fontFamily':'Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor H as Reviewer
  participant W as Web app
  participant G as ApprovalGate
  participant C as MCP client
  participant S as MCP server
  participant F as outputs and audit log
  H->>W: click Approve on one action
  W->>G: decide approved
  W->>W: issue signed receipt bound to tool and exact arguments
  W->>C: call tool with receipt id and arguments
  C->>S: tools/call over stdio
  S->>S: verify signature and tool and argument hash and unused
  alt receipt missing or content changed or replayed
    S-->>C: error, nothing written
  else valid
    S->>S: required arguments and PII re-scan
    S->>F: write file and append audit line
    S-->>C: result ok, sent false
  end
